{"c":[{"id":"0b347fe3d88d59693652675b59b880685fde23691a41f3118fda96c9747b7d7b","sum":"Files the script writes are part of the work; do not leave them untracked. Note membership is clone-portability on its own sentence; do not name OptMem in the prompt. Over-long note/nap prints Too long: N bytes, limit L; unknown id on identity-miss says copy from wake.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"4826b3cd066a8db2620210390a81c866632063b629b0c6d392ee396a30ce7a9a","sum":"Files the script writes are part of the work; do not leave them untracked. prompt-commit-notes archived (PR #15).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T143121Z-499b95db35c236dc","text":"Prompt: files the script writes are part of the work; do not leave them untracked. Not a separate git add procedure.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T143747Z-07042dccd58a8627","text":"prompt-commit-notes archived: files the script writes are part of your work; do not leave them untracked. Draft PR #15.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0e2730939d36cf17a89286ebd9a998c74e328ccd4fe5e8f6b4894759e1fd26cb","sum":"Note membership is clone-portability on its own sentence; do not name OptMem in the prompt. Over-long note/nap prints Too long: N bytes, limit L; unknown id on identity-miss says copy from wake.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T144333Z-54317d52fae15bc6","text":"Note membership: session spawn 'document this machine gap' beat the baked filter because it is a trailing clause in the mandatory-note paragraph. Store/CLI stay; split the test onto its own clone-portability sentence. Do not name OptMem in the prompt.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T150951Z-48c09749f6b4d942","text":"Over-long note and nap captions print Too long: N bytes, limit L. Accented characters cost 2 bytes. Compress it further. Identity-miss unknown id says copy from wake; a missing children file does not.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"528f08ae8bb4cf55e61ee2cb2820b7ea4e7359fe50f27467eb457914754ecf88","sum":"Register Memories notes clone-portable facts (dump vs membership split); dump line does not say git forever. Onboarding is docs/agents-prompt.md lockstep with prompt_text(); TDD does not govern consumer Actions YAML that only invokes a third-party action.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"e2a8c1aafb975d1255be62cc74c014574166bc1501da4f799d2041e25d93f0b9","sum":"Baked Register Memories: note a fact another contributor would still need; membership is clone-portability on its own sentence (dump vs membership split). Dump line no longer says git forever.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T152829Z-ff3349020923cee6","text":"Baked Register Memories: note when another contributor would still need the fact; membership is clone-portability on its own sentence. Dump line no longer says git forever.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T165146Z-3869ac160fa1eda4","text":"Draft PR #18: baked Register Memories splits dump from clone-portability membership; no store/CLI change.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"89acc35894e248e23a8823606c8ba122a3a1931afff4346b729ba66d0334114f","sum":"Onboarding is docs/agents-prompt.md, lockstep with prompt_text(); do not select wrapping init output. TDD does not govern consumer Actions YAML that only invokes a third-party action; it would if SumMem were an Action.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T184134Z-2efc5cdcb2d8b149","text":"Onboarding prompt is docs/agents-prompt.md, lockstep with prompt_text(); do not select wrapping init output.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T193911Z-1a2508c0f3d6386f","text":"TDD does not govern GitHub Actions YAML that only invokes a third-party action; it would if SumMem were an Action.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
